{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Inferno Wizards",
    "steam_appid": 1269960,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1269960/extras/18bf659886cbf9412ef5f0b99b5981f5.poster.avif?t=1589916725\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1269960/extras/18bf659886cbf9412ef5f0b99b5981f5.webm?t=1589916725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1269960/extras/18bf659886cbf9412ef5f0b99b5981f5.mp4?t=1589916725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Capture Wizard Towers</h2>Wizard towers can be captured by holding the first floor. When a tower is captured, the owners' new name shows up on the leaderboard. Other players can capture the tower, which steals the tower away from the existing player.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Kill Players</h2>Kill other players to gain XP, make it to the top of the leaderboard, and become the strongest player on the server! Team up with friends!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Upgrade New Spells</h2>Each level you gain a skill point that can be used to unlock and upgrade new spells.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Destroy Huts, Houses, Monsters, and World Bosses</h2>Huts and houses spawn NPCs. Kill the spawns to control where on the map XP is available. Kill monsters to gain XP. Stronger world bosses give a larger amount of XP.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Quests</h2>Quests introduce the mechanics of the game, unlock abilities, and offer an alternative route to gain levels and XP.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">More Updates Coming Soon!</h2>Xbox Controller Support<br><br>Join the discord for more updates and info!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">All feedback is welcome!</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1269960/extras/18bf659886cbf9412ef5f0b99b5981f5.poster.avif?t=1589916725\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1269960/extras/18bf659886cbf9412ef5f0b99b5981f5.webm?t=1589916725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1269960/extras/18bf659886cbf9412ef5f0b99b5981f5.mp4?t=1589916725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Capture Wizard Towers</h2>Wizard towers can be captured by holding the first floor. When a tower is captured, the owners' new name shows up on the leaderboard. Other players can capture the tower, which steals the tower away from the existing player.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Kill Players</h2>Kill other players to gain XP, make it to the top of the leaderboard, and become the strongest player on the server! Team up with friends!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Upgrade New Spells</h2>Each level you gain a skill point that can be used to unlock and upgrade new spells.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Destroy Huts, Houses, Monsters, and World Bosses</h2>Huts and houses spawn NPCs. Kill the spawns to control where on the map XP is available. Kill monsters to gain XP. Stronger world bosses give a larger amount of XP.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Quests</h2>Quests introduce the mechanics of the game, unlock abilities, and offer an alternative route to gain levels and XP.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">More Updates Coming Soon!</h2>Xbox Controller Support<br><br>Join the discord for more updates and info!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">All feedback is welcome!</h2>",
    "short_description": "Fight other players for control of wizard towers. A multiplayer action RPG with permadeath. Going for that sweet, sweet classic MMO feel.",
